# What GitHub counts as this repository's "language".
#
# Linguist counts BYTES of tracked files. Without this file it counts
# public/vendor/ as well -- 25.5 MB of Monaco, mermaid, three.js, Babel,
# cytoscape and xterm. The language bar then describes the libraries that were
# downloaded here, not the code that was written here.
#
# Measured over tracked files, grouped the way Linguist groups them
# (.tsx counts as TypeScript; .cjs, .mjs and .jsx count as JavaScript):
#
#   with vendor                 JavaScript 87.2%   TypeScript  7.8%
#   without vendor + generated  TypeScript 65.2%   JavaScript  4.3%
#
# The second pair is the honest one.
#
# JavaScript fell from 26.1% to 4.3% when the 91 test suites were renamed from
# .test.js to .test.ts -- 693 KB moved from one column to the other, with the
# suite unchanged at 91 passing files and 1221 passing tests. What remains is
# the .cjs launchers, platform shims and ops scripts, which are CommonJS by
# design and are not migration debt -- see docs/MIGRASI-TYPESCRIPT.md.
#
# Note for anyone reading the bar: Linguist marks languages of type `data`
# (JSON, JSON Lines) and `prose` (Markdown, Text) as not detectable, so those
# do not appear in the bar at all even though they are a large share of the
# bytes here. The bar shows only the programming and markup subset.

# -- Vendor: third-party libraries, not written here --
public/vendor/**       linguist-vendored
vendor/**              linguist-vendored
scripts/three/**       linguist-vendored
scripts/reactflow/**   linguist-vendored
scripts/ikon-bahasa/** linguist-vendored

# -- Generated: built from another source --
# The first three are gitignored as well, but are marked here so the accounting
# stays correct if anyone ever commits them.
electron/main.js         linguist-generated
electron/preload.js      linguist-generated
public/app.build.js      linguist-generated
# Emitted by scripts/ikon-bahasa/build.cjs from material-icon-theme; its own
# first line says DO NOT EDIT BY HAND. 22 KB of icon data, not authored code.
public/app/IkonBahasa.jsx linguist-generated

# -- Compressed assets: output of scripts/kompres-aset.cjs --
*.br                   binary linguist-generated
*.gz                   binary linguist-generated
